type: software
title: "ATLAS: Automated Transfer, Logging, Archiving, and Structures"
abstract: >-
  A workflow concept and set of scripts for managing sequencing and analysis
  data on high-performance computing clusters, with safe transfer, logging,
  temporary storage and archiving of studies.
